{"density":2.8125,"scaledDensity":2.8125,"fontScale":1,"texts":[{"text":"What format would you like for your video?","box":[45,-6386,990,53],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_agent_text","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"1. Video language: English\n2. Captions: Yes, include captions","box":[365,-6308,670,200],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":2,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_body","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"I'll create a drama based on this template — give me a moment...","box":[45,-6040,990,110],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":2,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_agent_text","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Story Outline & Characters Result","box":[45,-5874,990,46],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_header","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Story Outline","box":[90,-5749,900,40],"color":"#FFCCD5E1","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_label","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimary"},{"text":"【The New CEO】\nJulian announces that he will personally oversee the arts foundation and recruits Lauren after overhearing her criticism.\n\n【The Same Vision】\nLauren realizes Julian genuinely wants to support artists, and their shared purpose creates their first flirtatious moment.\n\n【After Hours】\nJulian remembers Lauren’s coffee order and reveals that the foundation was the dream of his late mother, a public-school art teacher.\n\n【Building It Together】\nWhile adjusting a painting’s position, Julian and Lauren move increasingly close and can no longer ignore their attraction.\n\n【More Than the Foundation】\nJulian admits that he wants more time with Lauren and promises to ask her out after the opening.\n\n【The Final Question】\nAfter dedicating the foundation to his mother and publicly thanking Lauren, Julian asks her on a date, and she accepts.\n\nPossible Characters:\n• Julian Cross — handsome American CEO in his early thirties; outwardly controlled and demanding, privately earnest, attentive, and awkward with romance.\n• Lauren Hale — capable American junior arts-foundation coordinator in her late twenties; overlooked but confident, thoughtful, and willing to challenge authority.\n• Host — polished adult American event host who briefly introduces Julian at the employee gathering.","box":[90,-5664,900,2147],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":41,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_body","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Characters Result","box":[90,-3424,900,40],"color":"#FFCCD5E1","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_characters_label","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimary"},{"text":"Julian Cross","box":[90,-3080,248,40],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Lauren Hale","box":[372,-3080,248,40],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Host","box":[654,-3080,248,40],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"The language is already set to English.","box":[45,-2927,990,53],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_agent_text","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Create storyboard","box":[635,-2849,400,143],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_body","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"I have created the six-beat storyboard for The Art of Falling, tracing Julian and Lauren's journey from corporate tension to their final date invitation.","box":[45,-2638,990,167],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_agent_text","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Create storyboard","box":[635,-2446,400,143],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_body","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"I'll create a storyboard — give me a moment...","box":[45,-2235,990,53],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_agent_text","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Here's your storyboard","box":[45,-2126,990,46],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_card_lead","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Storyboard Result","box":[90,-2007,680,40],"color":"#FFCCD5E1","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_card_header","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimary"},{"text":"View more","box":[770,-2009,175,43],"color":"#FF49B9FF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_card_view_more","window":0,"res":"@color/textLink"},{"text":"Scene 1 — The New CEO","box":[263,-1908,704,43],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Julian Cross stands rigid in the carpeted aisle of a brightly lit corporate auditorium, dressed in a sharp charcoal three-piece suit with dark tie, staring down at Lauren Hale who remains seated among the auditorium crowd in her navy blazer and white blouse, clutching a black leather folder against her lap with an upright, unflinching gaze.","box":[263,-1842,704,130],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Scene 2 — The Same Vision","box":[263,-1592,704,43],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"In a sunlit high-rise executive boardroom, Julian Cross and Lauren Hale sit shoulder to shoulder at the corner of a long polished mahogany table covered in blueprints and floor plans, his charcoal vest visible without his jacket, his hand flat on the table beside hers as both look down at the open blueprints.","box":[263,-1526,704,130],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Scene 3 — After Hours","box":[263,-1276,704,43],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Inside a dim foundation project office lit by a desk lamp and city nightscapes outside the window, Julian Cross leans against a metal cabinet with his jacket off, sleeves rolled to his elbows and tie loosened, while Lauren Hale sits in an office chair wearing an open cardigan over her blouse, looking up at him as her fingers rest on the shelf beside his.","box":[263,-1210,704,130],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Scene 4 — Building It Together","box":[263,-960,704,43],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"In an empty gallery hall illuminated by track spotlights, Julian Cross stands half a step behind Lauren Hale against an ivory exhibition wall, both with arms raised supporting a large oil painting frame, his body close to her back as Lauren turns her profile slightly upward to meet his downward gaze.","box":[263,-894,704,130],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Scene 5 — More Than the Foundation","box":[263,-644,704,43],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"On a high stone gallery balcony at night against city skyline lights, Julian Cross stands facing Lauren Hale at the brass railing, his charcoal suit jacket draped over his forearm as he leans in earnestly toward her, while Lauren gazes up at him with parted lips and both hands resting on the balustrade.","box":[263,-578,704,130],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Scene 6 — The Final Question","box":[263,-328,704,43],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Amid a crowded, chandelier-lit gallery gala filled with well-dressed patrons, Julian Cross stands in a sharp charcoal three-piece suit facing Lauren Hale in an elegant dark emerald evening dress, his expression softened and awkward with earnest hope as Lauren rests her hand lightly against his suit lapel with a radiant smile.","box":[263,-262,704,130],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Storyboard Preview","box":[90,13,900,40],"color":"#FFCCD5E1","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_animatic_header","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimary"},{"text":"The Art of Falling","box":[361,110,606,43],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_animatic_title","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"0:45","box":[361,153,606,43],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_animatic_duration","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"See your story as pictures with a voice telling it. The real video comes next.","box":[361,219,606,85],"color":"#FFCCD5E1","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":2,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_animatic_caption","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimary"},{"text":"Create video","box":[728,602,307,143],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_body","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Pick a video model and length on the card to start generating.","box":[45,813,990,110],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":2,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_agent_text","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Standard · Preview - 30 sec","box":[475,948,560,143],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_body","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"I'll create a video — give me a moment...","box":[45,1159,990,53],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_agent_text","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Generating videos with Seedance 2.0.","box":[90,1302,900,56],"color":"#FFCCD5E1","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_thinking","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimary"},{"text":"28486","box":[605,132,110,46],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_credit","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"}],"fills":[{"box":[0,0,1080,2400],"color":"#FF303030","radius":null,"id":null,"window":0},{"box":[0,0,1080,2400],"color":"#FF0C0C0C","radius":null,"id":null,"window":0,"res":"@drawable/bg_mini_drama_screen"},{"box":[365,-6308,670,200],"color":"#331E9AFF","radius":34,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_body","window":0,"res":"@drawable/bg_iris_drama_transcript"},{"box":[45,-5794,990,2799],"color":"#FF1A1F25","radius":34,"id":"id/layout_mini_drama_outline_card_body","window":0,"res":"@drawable/bg_mini_drama_result_card"},{"box":[90,-3472,900,3],"color":"#FF363B43","radius":null,"id":"id/divider_mini_drama_outline_characters","window":0,"res":"@color/outline01"},{"box":[90,-3339,248,248],"co